WEBVTT

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.590
<i>This is an ancient tale.</i>

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.630
<i>Deep in the green woods...</i>

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.530
<i>...was a peaceful capital.</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.740
<i>However...</i>

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.770
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.740
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.240
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:21.740
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:27.550
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:31.490
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:39.590
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:46.900
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:52.440
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:59.570
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:05.050
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:07.490
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:14.430
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.700
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.770
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:27.810
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.620
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.130
Roan!

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.170
We're so close to Fayon, too!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.160
Takius-<i>san</i>! Stop daydreaming!
Use your magic!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.280
Y-Yes!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.720
Frost...

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.800
...Diver!

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.040
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:37.780
I was slashing him!
Why'd you freeze him?!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.480
Who does he think he is?!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.790
I'm sorry!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.050
He didn't have to talk to her like that.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.560
Yuufa, where's the Pressing?!

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.920
Huh? Uh, what?!

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.720
Never mind, already!

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:21.190
Wonderful!

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.520
Roan!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.070
Holy...

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:34.970
--Stupid!
--"Stupid"?

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.140
Poring!

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.570
...Light!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.440
Yuufa!

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.700
Arrows?!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.360
Judia-<i>san</i>?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.960
Thank you. You were a great help.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:34.360
You're very welcome.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:38.100
I just happened to be hunting in the bamboo grove.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:43.540
She went and unleashed
Holy Light at the ghost.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:47.480
That only made him angrier, Yuufa.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.950
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.220
Anyhow, we would've been in trouble if you hadn't come.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.350
You're the Archer...

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:01.080
I'm Lin. Pleased to meet you.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:10.570
Really? You live in Fayon?

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:15.340
Yes, Archer Guild is there.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.000
I'll introduce you, Lin.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.740
This is Maaya, Takius, and Yuufa. And I'm...

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.080
...Roan, the leader.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.340
Wait a minute.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:24.480
Huh?

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:28.620
Who made you the leader?

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:32.050
But Iruga-<i>san</i> and Judia-<i>san</i> aren't here.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:35.490
And Takius-<i>san</i> seems to be tired, somehow.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.960
Somebody has to take charge.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.560
Still...

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.430
Don't worry! It'll be fine!

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:44.570
With me along, there'll be no problem.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:47.940
Like earlier, if not for Yuufa's mistake...

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.930
Right, Yuufa?

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.440
Yuufa?!

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:54.640
R-Right.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:59.150
Roan-<i>san</i>, you're young, but very strong, aren't you?

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:02.250
Oh, I'm not that strong...

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.850
Yuch!

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:05.420
Poring!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:10.490
By the way, Lin, has anything strange happened at Fayon?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:11.860
Strange?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:15.060
Like Monsters running wild...

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:16.760
Not really.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:22.040
There're Monsters deep in caves, but only Adventurers ever go there.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.670
I see. That's strange.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:29.710
Well, never mind. We're almost at Fayon.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.810
Let's get going!

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:34.820
Let's go.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.180
Look out!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.560
Are you all right, Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.680
Y-Yes...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.530
I'm here, so don't worry.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:48.860
Thank you.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.930
Yuck. Show-off.

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.100
Poring!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.400
Roan! My legs hurt. They're stiff!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.740
Massage them, massage them, massage them!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:04.140
I can't walk a step further!
Please, Roan!

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.320
Do you have a banana, Maaya-<i>chan</i>?

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.650
Huh?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.190
Sure, I do.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.020
Oh, thanks.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.120
Here, Yuufa. Eat this and get up your strength.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.890
Thank you...

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.280
Come, everyone, let's go!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.010
Yes, let's go, Roan-<i>san</i>!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.570
I expected to find a battleground.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.850
But it's peaceful.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.470
Yuufa!

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.830
Yuufa!

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.690
Oh, Roan! Thank goodness!

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:00.230
Look at me. I'm soaking wet.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:03.360
I was washing clothes and it fell down.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:07.070
You do it for me. Please.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:10.040
Please, please? Pretty please.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.810
You've got to do your own chores, Yuufa.

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:15.740
Huh?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:20.580
And clean up your own room. Got that?

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.790
<i>I've...</i>

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:47.740
<i>I've always obeyed</i>
<i>Zephyrus Sensei's orders.</i>

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:54.050
<i>That was everything to me. It was</i> <i>the path to the ultimate truth.</i>

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:59.240
<i>But...</i>

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:05.590
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.320
Good morning, child.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.690
Good morning.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:37.530
Granny, why do you always come here?

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:43.630
To pick mushrooms. If I pick plenty,
I'll give you some.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.230
Really?!

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:50.070
Mushrooms give you energy.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.330
Good luck!

00:11:56.740 --> 00:12:01.180
<i>♪ When you eat mushrooms,</i> <i>what do you get? ♪</i>

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.150
<i>♪ You get energy. ♪</i>

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:07.220
<i>♪ When you eat mushrooms,</i> <i>what do you get? ♪</i>

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:10.120
<i>♪ You get... ♪</i>

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.650
Now, what was that bell?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:33.250
No Monsters appeared, and there seems to be nothing out of the ordinary.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.780
Coming to Fayon was a waste of time.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:40.740
You seem unhappy that it's a peaceful town.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.720
Takius-<i>san...</i>

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:44.930
I'm thinking...

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:48.020
You don't suppose
Baphomet lied to us, did he?

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:53.070
Takius-<i>san</i>? Are you listening?

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.730
Roan-<i>san</i>!

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:59.140
It's awful! Monsters!

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.910
What?!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.810
They did appear, after all?!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:04.950
Come, everyone. Let's go!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.380
--Wait a minute!
--Huh?

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:09.750
So, who went and made you leader?

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:13.890
This isn't the time to discuss that!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.720
Roan is absolutely right.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.460
Let's hurry.

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:20.550
Fine, let's go!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:23.730
Lin, take us there.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.630
Yes, Roan-<i>san.</i>

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.870
Let's go.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:32.170
Oh! W-Wait for me!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.750
He thinks he's the Champion of Justice?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.480
Poring!

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.590
Where is this place?

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:53.250
It's the capital that was destroyed long ago.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:02.740
How terrible to destroy a city by force...

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:06.140
Prosperity and decline, I suppose.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:10.310
The strong win and survive.
The weak are destroyed.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:16.380
That is history.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:35.100
They've come!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:47.980
We did it!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.850
Good work, Lin!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.560
Wh-What's this?

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.690
Th-This is...

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.430
Takius-<i>san</i>! Use your magic!

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:04.990
Thunder...

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:08.040
...Storm!

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.370
Good!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.240
You did it, Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.870
Yes, that is good, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:27.720
There is no need for doubts. Fight.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.280
You must fight!

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:41.300
Holy... Cross!

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:55.150
T-There's no end to this!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.180
Wait!

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:05.290
Yuufa-<i>san</i>!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.280
Are you all right, Lin?

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.700
I-I'm cold!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.840
Listen to me...

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:22.210
Don't be afraid.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:24.710
Please...

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.310
Huh?

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:30.880
Listen to me...

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.220
We are a race destroyed.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:38.090
We were sleeping peacefully in this land, but...

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:39.960
Shield Charge!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:47.840
We have no desire for war.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:52.810
All we wish is to sleep in peace once more.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:55.380
Please save...

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.040
...our souls.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.920
Yuufa! What're you doing?!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.820
Roan!

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:07.880
How cruel. I...
I don't know what to do...

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:23.600
Yuufa?!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.740
What're you doing?!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.010
No, Roan! Stop!

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:30.210
Please. Our souls... Save our souls!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:33.110
Roan, can't you hear that voice?!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:36.280
Yuufa, what're you talking about?!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:39.520
Save... us...

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.560
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.160
Thunder...

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:48.390
Yes, that is good, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.390
...Storm!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.790
Yuufa! Let go of my arm!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:16.590
Look! He's controlling the spirits!

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:19.060
How cruel!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.630
What's wrong with you, Yuufa?!

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:23.760
No! Stop!

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.760
No!

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:38.440
I must...

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.280
Must save them...

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:45.650
You can keep killing them, but nothing will change.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:47.650
Their spirits...

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:50.360
I must save them, souls and all!

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:57.120
Heal!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.230
Lightning...

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.270
...Bolt!

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:13.310
Yes... That's splendid, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.980
Now... take it higher!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.320
Thunder...

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:23.520
...Storm!

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.160
Heal!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.640
I need more Healing power...

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:43.040
I'm an Acolyte.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.310
I must... save their souls.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.750
Please... save us!

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:57.360
I... After all, I... can't save anyone.

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.190
I can't save anything!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:06.990
Shield... Boomerang!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.170
We'll never be able to keep this up.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:25.120
Roan-<i>san</i>! I've brought everyone from the Guild.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.890
The arrows are my custom-made merchandise!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.380
Lin! Maaya-<i>chan...</i>

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:36.330
All right, retreat for now!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:41.960
Takius-<i>san</i>! Yuufa! Withdraw!

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:49.340
I haven't the power to save them... Not me...

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:51.650
Yuufa! Pull back!

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:53.510
Yuufa!

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:02.690
Now, everyone, please pay for the arrows.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.890
Poring!

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:07.330
Takius-<i>san</i>, are you all right?

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.630
Y-Yes.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:12.000
If you need any help, please let me know.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.130
Are you ill?

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:15.640
N-No...

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:16.970
But...

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.410
Roan...

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.740
Yuufa?

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:23.310
Roan, listen to me.

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:28.540
I... I want... I want to be a Priest.

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:37.690
Is that so? Do your best, Yuufa.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.590
Huh?

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:43.060
Roan, aren't you coming with me?

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:47.630
No. I'm staying here.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:49.640
I've got to protect them.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:52.230
I must protect this town!

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:57.280
I'll do my best, so you must, too.

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.480
Let's both work hard.

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:04.220
Ma-<i>chan</i> is going to Alberta to stock up on merchandise.

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:07.090
Good idea. Be counting on you.

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:13.360
I'm free! I can't look after Roan all by myself.

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:15.190
Poring!

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:21.800
Roan, I'll...

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:24.600
I'll do my best.

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:26.330
I will.

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:35.410
<i>This is Solin. Yuufa decides</i> <i>to become a Priest.</i>

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:37.680
<i>Will Roan understand her wishes?</i>

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:40.380
<i>And what ordeals await them?</i>

00:23:40.380 --> 00:23:43.180
<i>Next time,</i> "You Are Already Tainted."

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:45.620
<i>Yuufa, good luck!</i>
